en:
"It's not that you mustn't,
but if you were to explain about the Divine Realm,
people would begin to question what you are, Toner, to know such things."{w}

"Well, look at the vessel I'm in. I'm bound to be affected by it.
And you know, she's so warm and big!
The way she wraps you up, it's like..."{w}

"What should I do, huh?"{w}{p}"I don't mind either way.
It's just, the people who are still praying to Rogera...
they're kind of... you know."{w}{p}"Same goes for Dehain's followers, too."{w}

"It is common on every land."{w}{p}"Prayer and faith are what the heart leans on.
If they bring peace of mind,
the truth has no value."{w}

"Yeah, that!
Fulfaray made such a racket about it!"{w}{p}"Fulfaray kept going on and on, so I just got all excited right back.
And then off they ran, ranting and raving! Ahaha!"{w}

"I can go along with your story
as much as you like."{w}{p}"However, everything, this conversation included,
is surely being recorded by the System."{w}

"You know, I think Void's going to fail.
Even this sending-to-the-Horizon business
is actually insurance for when the Phase Shift happens..."{w}

"...Sorry."{w}{p}"But still, I don't want to just sit on the sidelines
and watch!
Apasha too -- I'll make them cough up that soul, no matter what!"{w}

"How lovely, you came again.
You're welcome to come every day, you know?
I'll take good care of you."{w}

"I heard there was some vampire woman
putting on airs as a 'Soul Therapist'.
That's you, right?"{w}
